@startuml DataFlow_v2
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
title Flujo de Datos - Registro Multidia y Motor Medico

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "ControlPanel" as UI
entity "useEngineStore" as Store
entity "calculator.ts" as CalcEngine
entity "rules.ts" as Rules
participant "Firestore" as DB
participant "MasterChart + WarningAlerts" as View

== Seleccion de Fecha ==
User -> UI : Navega con flechas entre dias
UI -> Store : setSelectedDate("2026-03-14")
Store -> CalcEngine : calculateDailyPerformance(logs, baseIq)
CalcEngine --> Store : ChartDataPoint[]
Store -> Rules : evaluateInteractions(logs)
Rules --> Store : Warning[]
Store --> View : Actualiza curva IQ y alertas

== Registro de Nuevo Evento ==
User -> UI : Busca suplemento, ingresa cantidad, hora y nota
UI -> Store : addLog(suppId, timeStr, qty, note)

activate Store
note over Store
  Crea LogEvent con:
  id (uuid), date (YYYY-MM-DD),
  supplementId, timeStr, quantity, note
end note

Store -> DB : setDoc(users/uid, allLogs, merge)
Store -> CalcEngine : recalcular(logsActualizados)

note over CalcEngine
  Acumulo = SUM( effectK * qty * e^(-age/durationH) )
  por cada evento antes de la hora evaluada
end note

CalcEngine --> Store : chartData[] recalculado
Store -> Rules : evaluateInteractions(logs)

note over Rules
  Evalua:
  - Toxicidad total hepatica/renal
  - Inhibicion enzimatica CYP450
  - Macros caloricos vs estimulantes
end note

Rules --> Store : Warning[] con sugerencias
deactivate Store

Store --> View : Actualizacion reactiva (Zustand)
View --> User : Curva IQ + Alertas clinicas

== Migracion desde Version Anterior ==
note over Store, DB
  Si Firestore tiene campo "logs" (formato v1 plano),
  se migra automaticamente a allLogs{fecha: events[]}
  usando el timestamp de cada evento para asignar la fecha.
end note

@enduml
